{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31595","headline":"醉後赠冯姬 · 李羣玉","name":"醉後赠冯姬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄昏歌舞促琼筵，银烛台西见小莲。\n二寸横波回慢水，一双纤手语香弦。\n桂形浅拂梁家黛，瓜字初分碧玉年。\n愿托襄王云雨梦，阳台今夜降神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}